# Android / Gradle build outputs
.gradle/
build/
local.properties
*.iml
.DS_Store
# Local Android SDK (downloaded via cmdline-tools; the CI runners have their own).
# Kept inside the repo dir for the local build only — never committed.
android-sdk/
gradle-dist/
gradle-8.9-bin.zip
# Gradle wrapper jar is committed intentionally (standard practice).
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
# NEVER commit workflow files from this machine: the VM's GitHub token has
# no `workflow` scope and pushes containing .github/workflows/* are rejected
# (403). The CI workflow is added by the maintainer via the GitHub web UI.
.github/
# Never commit the game APK, any dump, or any Miniclip asset.
*.apk
